# =============================================================================
# Gravedigger2026 — Git ignore
# Unity 工程位于子目录 Gravedigger2026/；模式不加根锚点，以便匹配嵌套路径。
# Unity 模板来源: https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Unity.gitignore
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unity 生成 / 缓存（勿提交）
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.utmp/
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/
*.log

# Blender 备份（Unity 可直接导入 .blend，无需 .blend1）
*.blend1
*.blend1.meta

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE / 解决方案（Unity 会重新生成）
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.idea/
.gradle/
ExportedObj/
.consulo/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.DotSettings.user

# JetBrains Rider 自动生成插件（**/ 适配嵌套 Unity 工程目录）
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unity 生成的 meta / 崩溃 / Mono
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta
sysinfo.txt
mono_crash.*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 构建产物
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
*.app

# Crashlytics
crashlytics-build.properties

# TestRunner
InitTestScene*.unity*
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ii]nit[Tt]est[Ss]cene*.unity*

# Addressables（默认忽略，定制后再按需放宽）
ServerData/
**/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/aa*
**/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/link.xml*
**/[Aa]ssets/Addressables_Temp*
**/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*

# Visual Scripting 自动生成
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db.meta
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers.meta

# Assets 内自动缓存
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]ceneDependencyCache*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.stackdump
*.lnk

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
__MACOSX/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 编辑器 / 工具（仓库约定）
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VS Code 本机覆盖（团队共享的 .vscode/ 设置如需提交可单独 unignore）
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json

# Cursor 本机缓存（保留 .cursor/rules、skills 等可共享内容）
.cursor/cache/
.cursor/*.log

# 本地临时 / 密钥（勿提交）
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
secrets/
credentials.json

# Node 依赖（.scratch 脚本等本地安装）
**/node_modules/

# 可选：Asset Store 工具插件（需要忽略时取消下一行注释）
# **/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*

# 第三方资源包（体积大，本地自行导入）
**/[Aa]ssets/SmallScaleInt/
**/[Aa]ssets/SmallScaleInt.meta
